### Summary

- Use a custom `PhysicalNamingStrategy` or `SpringPhysicalNamingStrategy` to ensure Hibernate uses the exact table names from `@Table` annotations.
- Configure your database to preserve case sensitivity if needed.
- Avoid default naming strategies that transform names to lowercase or uppercase.

This approach ensures that Hibernate respects the case-sensitive names specified in your annotations.

