在Java中，不使用Spring Boot框架，你可以使用Java的标准库（如`java.net.ServerSocket`和`javax.servlet`）来创建一个简单的HTTP服务器，接收图片数据。以下是一个使用`java.net.ServerSocket`的简单示例，它可以接收HTTP POST请求中的图片数据。

### 示例代码：使用 `ServerSocket` 接收图片数据

```java
import java.io.*;
import java.net.ServerSocket;
import java.net.Socket;
import java.nio.file.Files;
import java.nio.file.Paths;
import java.util.Base64;

public class ImageServer {

    private static final int PORT = 8080;
    private static final String SAVE_DIR = "uploads/";

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try (ServerSocket serverSocket = new ServerSocket(PORT)) {
            System.out.println("Server started on port " + PORT);

            while (true) {
                try (Socket clientSocket = serverSocket.accept()) {
                    System.out.println("Client connected: " + clientSocket.getInetAddress());
                    handleClient(clientSocket);
                } catch (IOException e) {
                    System.err.println("Error handling client: " + e.getMessage());
                }
            }
        } catch (IOException e) {
            System.err.println("Could not start server: " + e.getMessage());
        }
    }

    private static void handleClient(Socket clientSocket) throws IOException {
        BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(clientSocket.getInputStream()));
        PrintWriter out = new PrintWriter(clientSocket.getOutputStream(), true);

        StringBuilder requestBuilder = new StringBuilder();
        String line;
        while (!(line = in.readLine()).isEmpty()) {
            requestBuilder.append(line).append("\r\n");
        }

        String request = requestBuilder.toString();
        System.out.println("Received request:\n" + request);

        if (request.startsWith("POST /upload HTTP/1.1")) {
            String boundary = getBoundary(request);
            if (boundary != null) {
                handleMultipartRequest(in, boundary);
                out.println("HTTP/1.1 200 OK");
                out.println("Content-Type: text/plain");
                out.println();
                out.println("Image received and saved successfully.");
            } else {
                out.println("HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request");
                out.println("Content-Type: text/plain");
                out.println();
                out.println("Invalid request format.");
            }
        } else {
            out.println("HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found");
            out.println("Content-Type: text/plain");
            out.println();
            out.println("Endpoint not found.");
        }
    }

    private static String getBoundary(String request) {
        String[] lines = request.split("\r\n");
        for (String line : lines) {
            if (line.startsWith("Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=")) {
                return line.substring("Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=".length());
            }
        }
        return null;
    }

    private static void handleMultipartRequest(BufferedReader in, String boundary) throws IOException {
        String line;
        boolean isImageData = false;
        ByteArrayOutputStream imageData = new ByteArrayOutputStream();

        while ((line = in.readLine()) != null) {
            if (line.contains("Content-Disposition: form-data; name=\"image\"")) {
                isImageData = true;
                continue;
            }
            if (isImageData && line.contains("Content-Type: image")) {
                continue;
            }
            if (isImageData && line.equals("--" + boundary + "--")) {
                break;
            }
            if (isImageData && !line.isEmpty()) {
                imageData.write(Base64.getDecoder().decode(line));
            }
        }

        if (imageData.size() > 0) {
            saveImage(imageData.toByteArray());
        }
    }

    private static void saveImage(byte[] imageData) throws IOException {
        Files.createDirectories(Paths.get(SAVE_DIR));
        String fileName = SAVE_DIR + System.currentTimeMillis() + ".jpg";
        try (FileOutputStream fos = new FileOutputStream(fileName)) {
            fos.write(imageData);
            System.out.println("Image saved to: " + fileName);
        }
    }
}
```

### 代码说明：
1. **ServerSocket**：使用 `ServerSocket` 监听指定端口，等待客户端连接。
2. **HTTP请求处理**：解析HTTP请求，检查是否为POST请求且路径为`/upload`。
3. **多部分表单数据**：解析多部分表单数据（`multipart/form-data`），提取图片数据。
4. **保存图片**：将接收到的图片数据保存到本地文件系统。

