在Spring框架中，获取实现某个接口的`BeanDefinition`可以通过以下几种方式实现。这里假设你已经熟悉Spring的核心概念，如`BeanFactory`、`ApplicationContext`、`BeanDefinition`等。

### 1. 使用`BeanFactory`或`ApplicationContext`
如果你已经拥有`ApplicationContext`或`BeanFactory`的实例，可以通过遍历所有Bean定义来查找实现特定接口的Bean。

```java
import org.springframework.beans.factory.config.BeanDefinition;
import org.springframework.beans.factory.support.BeanDefinitionRegistry;
import org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext;
import org.springframework.core.type.StandardMethodMetadata;
import org.springframework.core.type.classreading.MetadataReader;
import org.springframework.core.type.classreading.SimpleMetadataReaderFactory;

import java.util.Map;

public class BeanDefinitionFinder {

    public static Map<String, BeanDefinition> findBeansImplementingInterface(ApplicationContext context, Class<?> interfaceClass) {
        BeanDefinitionRegistry registry = (BeanDefinitionRegistry) context.getAutowireCapableBeanFactory();
        String[] beanNames = context.getBeanDefinitionNames();
        Map<String, BeanDefinition> result = new HashMap<>();

        for (String beanName : beanNames) {
            BeanDefinition beanDefinition = registry.getBeanDefinition(beanName);
            if (isImplementingInterface(beanDefinition, interfaceClass)) {
                result.put(beanName, beanDefinition);
            }
        }

        return result;
    }

    private static boolean isImplementingInterface(BeanDefinition beanDefinition, Class<?> interfaceClass) {
        try {
            String beanClassName = beanDefinition.getBeanClassName();
            if (beanClassName == null) {
                return false;
            }

            Class<?> beanClass = Class.forName(beanClassName);
            return interfaceClass.isAssignableFrom(beanClass);
        } catch (ClassNotFoundException e) {
            return false;
        }
    }
}
```

### 2. 使用`BeanDefinitionReaderUtils`和`BeanDefinitionReader`
如果你在配置阶段需要获取实现某个接口的`BeanDefinition`，可以使用`BeanDefinitionReaderUtils`和`BeanDefinitionReader`。

