This JavaScript code works with the HTML chessboard structure where pieces have IDs like `r-1-w` (rook-1-white) and `n-1-w` (knight-1-white). It generates random moves for rooks and knights, applies them to the board, and alternates turns between white and black. The game auto-plays with a 1-second delay between moves.

