<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Dashboard</title>
</head>
<body>
    <h2>Welcome, <?php echo $_SESSION['username']; ?>!</h2>
    <a href="logout.php">Logout</a>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### **6. Logout**
Create a logout script (`logout.php`) to destroy the session.

**logout.php:**
```php
<?php
session_start();
session_unset();
session_destroy();
header("Location: login.php");
exit();
?>
```

---

### **7. Security Best Practices**
- **Password Hashing:** Always hash passwords using `password_hash()` and verify them with `password_verify()`.
- **Prepared Statements:** Use prepared statements to prevent SQL injection.
- **HTTPS:** Use HTTPS to encrypt data transmitted between the client and server.
- **Input Validation:** Validate and sanitize user inputs to prevent XSS and other attacks.

